SUMMARY:AMC Friday Evening Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Purristess + Star Tribe
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, April 24th\n\nEvening 
 Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nD
 J Purristess + Star Tribe\nIntention: TBA\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please no
 te that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening C
 ircle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ens
 ure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or nam
 e your price.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\nPre-registration R
 ecommended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/weekly-dance/\n\n\\~\
 \~\\~\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Reg
 ister to volunteer at:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/
 \n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the open
 ing circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nColl
 ective agreements:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/\n\n
 About AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in 
 harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving co
 mmunity. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy commu
 nity through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and commu
 nity transformation.\n\nAMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\n\\~\
 \~\\~\n\nSee you on the dance floor!"
